WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.139
IN SEPTEMBER OF 2022 OUR
OFFICE OF STUDENT AFFAIRS

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.908
REPORTED TO THE
MULTI-DISCIPLINARY THREAT

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.811
ASSESSMENT TEAM THAT MR. JONES,
THEY RECEIVED INFORMATION THAT

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:16.416
MR. JONES HAD MADE A COMMENT
ABOUT POSSESSING A GUN TO A

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:21.287
PERSON THAT WAS UNAFFILIATED
WITH THE UNIVERSITY.

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:27.460
IN OTHER WORDS, A THIRD PARTY.
THAT REPORTING PERSON, AGAIN

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.463
UNAFFILIATED WITH THE
UNIVERSITY, TO BEST OF OUR

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:36.569
KNOWLEDGE NEVER SAW THE GUN.
THE COMMENT ABOUT MR. JONES

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:43.509
OWNING A GUN WAS NOT MADE IN
CONJUNCTION WITH ANY THREATS.

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:44.911
THE OFFICE OF STUDENT AFFAIRS
FOLLOWED UP WITH THE REPORTING

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:47.747
PERSON AND MADE EFFORTS TO
CONTACT MR. JONES.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:52.318
IN FACT, THEY FOLLOWED UP WITH
MR. JONES ROOMMATE WHO DID NOT

00:00:52.318 --> 00:01:01.227
REPORT SEEING THE PRESENCE OF A
WEAPON.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:09.202
PARDON ME.
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU, CAPTAIN.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:25.051
WE JUST RECEIVED INFORMATION
THAT THE SUSPECT IS IN

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:41.301
CUSTODY.
JUST GIVING A MOMENT TO THANK

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:45.438
GOD.
BREATHE A SIGH OF RELIEF.

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:48.708
MR. JONES ALSO HAD COME TO THE
ATTENTION OF OUR THREAT

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:52.445
ASSESSMENT TEAM BECAUSE HE WAS
INVOLVED IN A -- A HAZING

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:54.747
INVESTIGATION OF SOME SORT.
I DON'T KNOW THE FACTS AND

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.949
CIRCUMSTANCES OF THAT
INVESTIGATION.

00:01:56.949 --> 00:02:01.721
I KNOW THAT IT WAS EVENTUALLY
CLOSED DUE TO WITNESSES THAT

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:04.924
WOULD NOT COOPERATE WITH THE
PROCESS.

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:09.195
BUT THROUGH THE COURSE OF THE
THREAT ASSESSMENT TEAM'S

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:11.998
INVESTIGATION WE LEARNED OF A
PRIOR CRIMINAL INCIDENT

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:15.735
INVOLVING A CONCEALED WEAPON
INCIDENT THAT OCCURRED OUTSIDE

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:18.638
OF THE CITY OF CHARLOTTESVILLE
IN FEBRUARY OF 2021.

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:22.041
WHAT IS INTERESTING ABOUT THIS
CASE IS HE'S REQUIRED AS A

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:25.645
STUDENT AT THE UNIVERSITY OF
VIRGINIA TO REPORT THAT AND HE

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:29.682
NEVER DID.
AND SO THE UNIVERSITY HAS TAKEN

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:33.486
APPROPRIATE ADMINISTRATIVE
CHARGES THROUGH THE UNIVERSITY'S

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:37.490
JUDICIARY COUNCIL AND THAT
MATTER IS STILL PENDING

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.659
ADJUDICATION.
I THOUGHT IT WAS IMPORTANT TO

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:44.063
SHARE THAT INFORMATION WITH YOU.
TO LET YOU KNOW THAT HE HAD BEEN

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:48.001
CALLED TO OUR ATTENTION AND TO
ANSWER ANY QUESTIONS YOU MIGHT

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.836
HAVE ABOUT THAT.
I WANT YOU TO HEAR THAT.

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:54.741
I WANT YOU TO HEAR THAT FROM ME.
NOT HEAR IT FROM SOMEONE ELSE.

00:02:54.741 --> 00:03:01.180
SO I'LL STOP THERE AND WE'LL
TAKE ANY QUESTIONS THAT YOU

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:07.920
MIGHT HAVE.
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE TIME FOR A COUPLE OF

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:10.990
QUESTIONS.
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU DISCUSS WHAT -- WHERE

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.160
THEY ARE GOING, WHAT IS THE
AFFILIATION OF THE PEOPLE THAT

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:19.032
WERE ON THAT BUS AND ON THAT
TRIP AND IF THE SUSPECT WAS PART

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:24.136
OF THAT TRIP OR STEPPED OFF OF
THE BUS?

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:28.508
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU FOR THE QUESTION.
THE INFORMATION WE HAVE AT THIS

00:03:28.508 --> 00:03:31.811
TIME THAT THE FIELD TRIP WAS
ASSOCIATED WITH A CLASS AND THE

00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:38.217
INDIVIDUALS THAT HAVE BEEN NAMED
WERE PART OF THAT TRIP TO SEE A

00:03:38.217 --> 00:03:41.554
PLAY.
THAT IS TO SEE A PLAY ASSOCIATED

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:43.022
WITH THE CLASS.
SO IT WAS A CLASS FIELD TRIP.

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:46.192
&gt;&gt; WAS THE SUSPECT IN THAT
CLASS?

00:03:46.192 --> 00:03:50.330
&gt;&gt; I DO NOT HAVE THOSE DETAILS.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU KNOW WHAT CLASS IT

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.197
WAS?
&gt;&gt; I DO NOT.

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:53.132
&gt;&gt; DO YOU KNOW WHAT THE PLAY IT
WAS.

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:55.268
&gt;&gt; I DO NOT.
WE'RE SEEKING OUT ALL OF THAT

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:59.372
INFORMATION AS YOU COULD
IMAGINE, THE STUDENTS ARE QUITE

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:03.810
TRAUMATIZED BY THE TRAGIC
EVENTS.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.746
&gt;&gt; I DO NOT HAVE THE EXACT
LOCATION.

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:14.620
WE'LL FINALIZING ALL OF THAT.
&gt;&gt; SO THE PLAY WAS IN

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:20.593
WASHINGTON, D.C.?
&gt;&gt; I HAVE NOT BEEN -- SHARED

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:25.998
THAT INFORMATION YET AND IT WILL
COME A POINT IN TIME WHEN WE

00:04:25.998 --> 00:04:37.543
WILL SHARE THAT INFORMATION BUT
NOW IS NOT THE MOST APPROPRIATE

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:38.511
TIME.
&gt;&gt; [ INAUDIBLE QUESTION ].

00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:40.480
&gt;&gt; WE'RE NOT RELEASING
INFORMATION ABOUT THE PATIENTS

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:53.826
WHO ARE STILL IN THE HOSPITAL AT
THIS TIME.

00:04:53.826 --> 00:04:57.230
&gt;&gt; [ INAUDIBLE QUESTION ].
&gt;&gt; I CAN'T SPEAK FOR STUDENT

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.431
AFFAIRS.
THE UNIVERSITY OF POLICE

00:04:58.431 --> 00:05:00.166
DEPARTMENT HAD NO CONTACT WITH
THIS.

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:01.768
THE UNIVERSITY OF POLICE
DEPARTMENT IS ONE OF MANY PEOPLE

00:05:01.768 --> 00:05:05.805
ON THE MULTI-DISCIPLINARY THREAT
ASSESSMENT TEAM AND WE PROVIDE

00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:08.441
SOME OF THE BACKGROUND WITH
RESPECT TO INDIVIDUALS TO COME

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:13.312
BEFORE THAT TEAM BUT TO MY
KNOWLEDGE WE DO NOT HAVE ANY

00:05:13.312 --> 00:05:20.953
CONTACT WITH MR. JONES WITH
REGARD TO THAT INCIDENT.

00:05:20.953 --> 00:05:24.991
&gt;&gt; [ INAUDIBLE QUESTION ].
&gt;&gt; MY UNDERSTANDING IS ABOUT

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:35.468
BALLPARK 25.
DON'T KNOW HOW HE GOT AWAY OR HE

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:42.942
FLED THE SCENE AND I DON'T HAVE
INFORMATION AS TO HOW HE WAS

00:05:42.942 --> 00:05:44.010
APPREHENDED.
&gt;&gt; [ INAUDIBLE QUESTION ].

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:55.087
&gt;&gt; WE'RE IN THE PROCESS OF DOING
THAT NOW.

00:05:55.087 --> 00:05:57.089
&gt;&gt; [ INAUDIBLE QUESTION ].
&gt;&gt; NOT AT THIS TIME.

00:05:57.089 --> 00:05:58.791
&gt;&gt; WHEN AND WHERE DID THE THIRD
VICTIM DIE?

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:01.160
IT SAID TWO WERE FOUND DEAD ON
THE BUS.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:06.332
&gt;&gt; THIRD VICTIM WAS TRANSPORTED
TO THE MEDICAL CENTER AND DIED

00:06:06.332 --> 00:06:07.600
THERE.
&gt;&gt; JUST A COUPLE OF MORE.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.636
DO WE KNOW MR. JONES STATUS.
AT ONE POINT HE WAS ON THE THE

00:06:10.636 --> 00:06:12.505
FOOTBALL TEAM.
HE WAS STILL A STUDENT HERE AS

00:06:12.505 --> 00:06:15.741
OF THIS MORNING.
WAS HE STILL AFFILIATED WITH THE

00:06:15.741 --> 00:06:17.777
FOOTBALL TEAM?
&gt;&gt; HE WAS STILL A STUDENT BUT TO

00:06:17.777 --> 00:06:20.980
MY KNOWLEDGE HE WAS NO LONGER ON
THE FOOTBALL TEAM AND HADN'T

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:24.784
BEEN ON THE TEAM FOR OVER A
YEAR.

00:06:24.784 --> 00:06:35.094
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU ABLE TO --
&gt;&gt; THE TWO OTHER VICTIMS WERE

00:06:35.094 --> 00:06:37.463
STUDENTS.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU THE POLICE KNOW AT ALL

00:06:37.463 --> 00:06:39.932
THE SUSPECT PRIOR TO THIS?
WAS THERE ANY RELATIONSHIP?

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:44.070
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW TO WHAT EXTENT
THEY HAVE A RELATIONSHIP WITH

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:48.074
HIM.
I DON'T KNOW THAT FOR SURE.

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:53.312
&gt;&gt; YOU PERSONALLY HAVE BEEN
INVOLVED WITH SO MANY TRAGEDIES

00:06:53.312 --> 00:06:57.583
IN YOUR TIME HERE IN
CHARLOTTESVILLE.

00:06:57.583 --> 00:07:03.623
I DON'T KNOW IF YOU'VE BEEN ABLE
TO PROCESS THIS COMMUNITY OVER

00:07:03.623 --> 00:07:06.392
THE PAST DECADE AND HOW THIS
IMPACTED ALL OF IT.

00:07:06.392 --> 00:07:10.429
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW THAT I BARELY
HAD TIME TO PROCESS THAT TO THE

00:07:10.429 --> 00:07:14.534
EXTENT THAT YOU SPEAK OF.
COY TELL YOU THAT THE PEOPLE

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:20.873
STANDING BEHIND ME NOW, IT
SPEAKS FOR ITSELF.

00:07:20.873 --> 00:07:26.612
HOW WE GET THROUGH THESE THINGS,
THESE AGENCIES THAT ARE

00:07:26.612 --> 00:07:37.957
REPRESENTED HERE WERE ON THE
GROUNDS VERY QUICKLY.

00:07:37.957 --> 00:07:41.160
I'LL TRY TO DO BETTER NEXT TIME.
THAT IS ALL I HAVE FOR RIGHT

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:44.030
NOW.
WE CAN'T DO THIS ALONE AND WE

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:46.599
OBVIOUSLY HAVEN'T.
AND WE --

00:07:46.599 --> 00:07:49.035
&gt;&gt; DO YOU KNOW IF THE SUSPECT
WAS FOUND ON CAMPUS OR OFF

00:07:49.035 --> 00:07:52.038
CAMPUS AT LEAST.
&gt;&gt; OR WHERE HE IS IN CUSTODY AT

00:07:52.038 --> 00:07:53.639
THIS TIME OR WHO BROUGHT HIM
INTO CUSTODY.

00:07:53.639 --> 00:07:56.442
&gt;&gt; WOULD YOU TELL YOU TO THE
BEST OF MY KNOWLEDGE HE WAS NOT

00:07:56.442 --> 00:07:58.677
FOUND ON CAMPUS.
I DID NOT TELL YOU WHERE HE WAS

00:07:58.677 --> 00:08:02.248
LOCATED OR WHERE HE WAS TAKEN
INTO CUSTODY OR WHERE HE IS

00:08:02.248 --> 00:08:03.983
LOCATED NOW.
&gt;&gt; STATE POLICE TAKE HIM INTO

00:08:03.983 --> 00:08:05.084
CUSTODY.
&gt;&gt; WE'LL HAVE MORE INFORMATION

00:08:05.084 --> 00:08:10.022
ON THAT.
THANK YOU ALL VERY MUCH.

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:12.825
WE'LL HAVE MORE INFORMATION.
&gt;&gt; SO A MAJOR DEVELOPMENT.

00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:19.231
YOU SAW JUST PLAYING OUT IN THE
MIDST OF THIS PRESS CONFERENCE.

00:08:19.231 --> 00:08:22.168
THEY BEGIN OVER THE SHOOTING AT
UVA WITH THE POLICE AND THE

00:08:22.168 --> 00:08:24.437
PRESIDENT OF THE UNIVERSITY
CALLING FOR HELP AND ASSISTANCE

00:08:24.437 --> 00:08:27.406
TO LOCATE THE SUSPECT AND THEN
IN THE MIDDLE OF THE PRESS

00:08:27.406 --> 00:08:31.177
CONFERENCE THE CHIEF OF POLICE
RECEIVING WORD FROM HIS DEPUTY

00:08:31.177 --> 00:08:33.646
THAT THE SUSPECT IS NOW IN
CUSTODY.

00:08:33.646 --> 00:08:38.751
AS WE KNOW NOW THAT ALL OF THE
PEOPLE WHO WERE KILLED IN THIS

00:08:38.751 --> 00:08:42.288
INCIDENT AND WOUNDED WERE
STUDENTS INVOLVED IN THIS MASS

00:08:42.288 --> 00:08:47.393
SHOOTING AT UVA OVERNIGHT.
JON MILLER IS HERE WITH ME.

00:08:47.393 --> 00:08:49.562
JON, IMPORTANT, THE SUSPECT IS
IN CUSTODY.

00:08:49.562 --> 00:08:51.931
THEY ARE CLEARLY NOT PREPARED TO
GIVE MORE ON THAT BECAUSE THE

00:08:51.931 --> 00:08:54.967
CLEAVE OF POLICE JUST FOUND IT
OUT IN THE MIDDLE OF THE PRESS

00:08:54.967 --> 00:08:56.369
CONFERENCE.
BUT THERE IS A LOT THAT WE

00:08:56.369 --> 00:08:59.705
LEARNED ABOUT PREVIOUS
INTERACTIONS AND WHAT HAPPEN AND

00:08:59.705 --> 00:09:09.348
HOW THIS PLAYED OUT JUST NOW.
&gt;&gt; SO WHAT WE LEARNED IS THAT

00:09:09.348 --> 00:09:10.416
THIS IS SOMEONE THAT WAS FLAGGED
AT UVA.

00:09:10.416 --> 00:09:11.884
THIS IS A ADVANCED PROCESS WHERE
THEY HAVE PEOPLE FROM STUDENT

00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:15.087
AFFAIRS, REPRESENTATIVES FROM
THE POLICE DEPARTMENT,

00:09:15.087 --> 00:09:19.091
PSYCHOLOGISTS WHO ASSESS
THREATS, THE THREAT INVOLVED

00:09:19.091 --> 00:09:22.695
SOMEBODY REPORTING CHRIS JONES
HAD MADE A STATEMENT THAT HE HAD

00:09:22.695 --> 00:09:24.397
A GUN.
THEY INTERVIEWED HIS ROOMMATE

00:09:24.397 --> 00:09:27.333
WOULD SAID HE HAD NEVER SEEN A
GUN.

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:30.503
THEY INTERVIEWED THE COMPLAINANT
WHO SAID THERE WAS NO THREAT

00:09:30.503 --> 00:09:34.240
THAT CAME WITH THE IDEA THAT HE
MADE A STATEMENT ABOUT HAVING A

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.876
GUN.
BUT AS WE PEEL BACK THE LAYERS,

00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:42.314
WE SEE HE ALSO SEEMS TO HAVE AN
ARREST OUTSIDE OF CAMPUS FOR AN

00:09:42.314 --> 00:09:46.886
ILLEGAL WEAPON THE YEAR BEFORE.
SO, WE'RE STARTING TO PEEL BACK

00:09:46.886 --> 00:09:53.225
THE LAYERS OF EARLY SIGNS THAT
THIS INDIVIDUAL WAS HEADED FOR

00:09:53.225 --> 00:09:55.761
TROUBLE.
WHAT IS REMARKABLE TO ME IS THAT

00:09:55.761 --> 00:09:58.864
ALL OF THIS CAME OUT IN THE
FIRST PRESS CONFERENCE.

00:09:58.864 --> 00:10:03.669
IN OTHER WORDS, RATHER THAN WAIT
FOR TWO DAYS LATER, EARLY SIGNS

00:10:03.669 --> 00:10:10.976
WERE MISSED, POLICE DID THIS OR
THAT, FOR TIM LONGO, THE KMCHIE

00:10:10.976 --> 00:10:15.281
OF POLICE FOR UVA TO PUT THAT
OUT FRONT AND SAY I'M TELLING

00:10:15.281 --> 00:10:19.552
YOU EVERYTHING THAT WE HAVE
RIGHT NOW IS A BIG DIFFERENCE

00:10:19.552 --> 00:10:21.653
FROM WHAT WE SEE.
IT IS A HIGH LEVEL OF

00:10:21.653 --> 00:10:22.955
TRANSPARENCY AND I THINK THEY
HAVE TO GET CREDIT FOR THAT.

